    "body": "Re-review at head cdf52b9c1b451ea4342bf9654a517b5b03b1b4a4. Clean except one minor point.\n\nEarlier points, now fixed:\n- Re-apply and re-reply loop: an applied claim is skipped (label set and claimant is assignee), and a held reply is posted only if no later comment mentions the claimant.\n- Window: 4 h.\n- A claimed issue with no findable claim comment is now held, not taken over.\n\nRemaining (minor, AGENTS.md contradiction): the window only finds claims created in the last 4 h. AGENTS.md's freshness rule is \"older than 4 hours with no newer comment from the claimant\". A claimant who posted more than 4 h ago and has commented since is therefore never applied, so their issue is not picked while the claim is fresh. Either widen the search to claimant follow-ups or state the gap in the rule.\n\nNot approved, not merged.\n",
